[00:39.66]It's late and I'm awake
{"夜深人静我仍清醒"}
[00:44.92]Staring at the wall
{"凝视着斑驳墙壁"}
[00:48.59]Open up my window
{"轻轻推开那扇窗"}
[00:52.34]My head floats out the door
{"思绪飘向门外去"}
[00:56.30]No one else around
{"四周空无一人"}
[00:59.42]And a shimmer takes my eye
{"微光忽然掠过眼底"}
[01:03.80]I lift my head
{"我仰起头"}
[01:06.94]I'm blinded by the sky
{"漫天星光刺痛眼睛"}
[01:11.67]Feel my weight in front
{"感受身前重力"}
[01:15.28]Following the sound
{"循着那声响而去"}
[01:19.10]It moves away so fast
{"它转瞬消逝无踪"}
[01:22.31]I fall down to the ground
{"我跌落在尘埃里"}
[01:26.78]I know there's more to come
{"明知故事未完结"}
[01:29.90]Jump back to my feet
{"猛然跃起身形"}
[01:34.06]And I only see ahead of me
{"眼中只剩前方风景"}
[01:38.18]Chasing down the street (down the street)
{"在街道追逐不停（追逐不停）"}
[02:19.37]Gave my love to a shooting star
{"将爱意托付流星"}
[02:22.12]But she moves so fast
{"可她飞驰如风"}
[02:23.99]That I can't keep up
{"让我难以追随"}
[02:25.89]I'm chasing
{"我追逐着"}
[02:26.89]I'm in love with a shooting star
{"深爱着那颗流星"}
[02:29.55]But she moves so fast
{"可她飞驰如风"}
[02:31.40]When she falls then
{"当陨落时刻来临"}
[02:33.71]I'll be waiting
{"我会在此守候"}
[02:34.42]Gave my love to a shooting star
{"将爱意托付流星"}
[02:37.07]But she moves so fast
{"但她飞驰而过"}
[02:39.12]That I can't keep up
{"快得我追不上"}
